    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start from the bottom. Rise to the top. Alone or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mall Control</i>, you begin broke in a shady hideout, staring at the glowing lights of a shopping mall that could one day be yours. Work your way up by buying your first shop, stocking it with just enough products to attract curious customers\u2026 and maybe bending a few rules along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build your empire by day\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcbb Hack your way to power by night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Solo or Co-op</strong>: Build your mall empire alone or team up with friends online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfea <strong>Own Shops</strong>: Purchase, manage, and customize stores to increase revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.poster.avif?t=1753174011\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.webm?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.mp4?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Stock Smart</strong>: Strategically stock your products to meet demand and beat competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/4d3e343a49dd1b1d136bae14ded4af8e.poster.avif?t=1753174011\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/4d3e343a49dd1b1d136bae14ded4af8e.webm?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/4d3e343a49dd1b1d136bae14ded4af8e.mp4?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Night Ops</strong>: Sneak into rival shops to steal data and sabotage\u00a0 but watch out for bodyguards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Grow from Rags to Retail Ruler</strong>: Every decision affects your rise\u00a0 will you play it clean or dirty?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're charming customers or dodging security in the dark, <i>Mall Control</i> is a unique blend of <strong>simulation, strategy, and stealth</strong> with a dash of dark humor.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start from the bottom. Rise to the top. Alone or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mall Control</i>, you begin broke in a shady hideout, staring at the glowing lights of a shopping mall that could one day be yours. Work your way up by buying your first shop, stocking it with just enough products to attract curious customers\u2026 and maybe bending a few rules along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build your empire by day\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcbb Hack your way to power by night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Solo or Co-op</strong>: Build your mall empire alone or team up with friends online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfea <strong>Own Shops</strong>: Purchase, manage, and customize stores to increase revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.poster.avif?t=1753174011\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.webm?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.mp4?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Stock Smart</strong>: Strategically stock your products to meet demand and beat competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/4d3e343a49dd1b1d136bae14ded4af8e.poster.avif?t=1753174011\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/4d3e343a49dd1b1d136bae14ded4af8e.webm?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788760/extras/4d3e343a49dd1b1d136bae14ded4af8e.mp4?t=1753174011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Night Ops</strong>: Sneak into rival shops to steal data and sabotage\u00a0 but watch out for bodyguards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Grow from Rags to Retail Ruler</strong>: Every decision affects your rise\u00a0 will you play it clean or dirty?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're charming customers or dodging security in the dark, <i>Mall Control</i> is a unique blend of <strong>simulation, strategy, and stealth</strong> with a dash of dark humor.</p></li></ul>",
